const n='---\ntitle: "Qingpu Listing Channels"\ndescription: "Channel draft library APIs for the Qingpu listing workbench"\n---\n\n# Qingpu Listing Channels API\n\nThis module documents the Qingpu listing workbench channel-draft library endpoints. The library reads from `qingpu_listing_channel_drafts` and only returns active rows where `deleted_at is null`.\n\n## Setup\n\n1. Configure `QINGPU_DATABASE_URL` or reuse `DATABASE_URL`.\n2. Execute the SQL file at `app/themes/qingpu/database/listing.sql`.\n3. Call the listing endpoints under `/api/qingpu/listing/channels*`.\n\n## Storage Rules\n\n- Channel draft rows live in `qingpu_listing_channel_drafts`.\n- `deleted_at` is the authoritative soft-delete flag for draft rows.\n- Rebuilding or resubmitting a draft clears `deleted_at` back to `null`.\n- The channels page only shows the default Ozon template row: `channel=\'ozon\'` and `store_key=\'\'`.\n\n---\n\n## 1. List Channel Drafts\n\n- **Endpoint**: `/api/qingpu/listing/channels?page=1&limit=50&search=`\n- **Method**: `GET`\n- **Authentication**: Required (User Session or Bearer tenant key)\n\n### Query Parameters\n\n| Name | Type | Required | Description |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `page` | `number` | No | 1-based page index. Defaults to `1`. |\n| `limit` | `number` | No | Page size. Defaults to `50`, max `100`. |\n| `search` | `string` | No | Matches product title or source product id. |\n| `showDeleted` | `boolean` | No | When `true`, include soft-deleted drafts in the list. |\n\n### Success Response\n\n```json\n{\n  "code": 0,\n  "data": {\n    "items": [\n      {\n        "productId": "p_123",\n        "title": "Storage Box",\n        "mainImageUrl": "https://example.com/image.png",\n        "skuCount": 3,\n        "categoryName": "Home Storage",\n        "preprocessStatus": "generated",\n        "updatedAt": "2026-07-20T12:00:00.000Z",\n        "draft": {\n          "channel": "ozon",\n          "ready": true,\n          "errors": [],\n          "steps": [\n            { "key": "translate", "done": true },\n            { "key": "copy", "done": true },\n            { "key": "images", "done": true },\n            { "key": "category", "done": true }\n          ],\n          "checkedAt": "2026-07-20T11:58:00.000Z"\n        }\n      }\n    ],\n    "total": 1,\n    "page": 1,\n    "limit": 50\n  }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## 2. Soft Delete Channel Draft\n\n- **Endpoint**: `/api/qingpu/listing/channels/delete`\n- **Method**: `POST`\n- **Authentication**: Required (User Session or Bearer tenant key)\n\n### Request Body\n\n```json\n{\n  "productId": "p_123",\n  "channel": "ozon"\n}\n```\n\n### Success Response\n\n```json\n{\n  "code": 0,\n  "data": {\n    "deletedCount": 1\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Notes\n\n- This operation does not physically delete the row.\n- The API sets `qingpu_listing_channel_drafts.deleted_at = now()`.\n- Re-running the draft submission flow can recreate or reactivate the row later.\n\n---\n\n## 3. Restore Channel Draft\n\n- **Endpoint**: `/api/qingpu/listing/channels/restore`\n- **Method**: `POST`\n- **Authentication**: Required (User Session or Bearer tenant key)\n\n### Request Body\n\n```json\n{\n  "productId": "p_123",\n  "channel": "ozon"\n}\n```\n\n### Success Response\n\n```json\n{\n  "code": 0,\n  "data": {\n    "restoredCount": 1\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Notes\n\n- This operation clears `qingpu_listing_channel_drafts.deleted_at` back to `null`.\n- The channels page can optionally display deleted drafts through `showDeleted=true`.\n\n---\n\n## 4. Permanently Delete Channel Draft\n\n- **Endpoint**: `/api/qingpu/listing/channels/purge`\n- **Method**: `POST`\n- **Authentication**: Required (User Session or Bearer tenant key)\n\n### Request Body\n\n```json\n{\n  "productId": "p_123",\n  "channel": "ozon"\n}\n```\n\n### Success Response\n\n```json\n{\n  "code": 0,\n  "data": {\n    "deletedCount": 1\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Notes\n\n- This only works for channel drafts that are already soft-deleted.\n- The API physically deletes the matching row from `qingpu_listing_channel_drafts`.\n- It does not affect the source product or workspace row.\n';export{n as default};
